* ''Every boot rests at the floor until a human unlocks'' (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/waking-floor`>>). At the floor every fleet lane stays shut, and the custody write, receipt and dyad capabilities of the island record answer the daemon island alone. A bounded ember stays design input: it raises to SERVING alone, never signs or admits, runs on a count and never a clock, needs the device's own unlock plus a second signal, records each raise, and any other device of the human removes it.

